    "detailed_description": "Master the mechanics of drifting alone or invite your friends for some multiplayer tandem action! Compete against each other for the highest score! Drift With Your Pals is a free casual cartoony drift game with real car physics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220200/extras/09e021f04215f2bd52dda5e9e40b3125.poster.avif?t=1668880920\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220200/extras/09e021f04215f2bd52dda5e9e40b3125.webm?t=1668880920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220200/extras/09e021f04215f2bd52dda5e9e40b3125.mp4?t=1668880920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master controls.</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Destructable terrain.</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Scoring system that accounts for speed and drift angle.</strong> <br></li><li><strong>A small roster of drift cars inspired by real-world classics, each with their own handling and feel.</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Play with your friends! Drift With Your Pals has multiplayer support for lobbies of up to 15 players.</strong></li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220200/extras/af8573e8df3d6885dd246c857d80b79b.poster.avif?t=1668880920\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220200/extras/af8573e8df3d6885dd246c857d80b79b.webm?t=1668880920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220200/extras/af8573e8df3d6885dd246c857d80b79b.mp4?t=1668880920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The cars in Drift With Your Pals are designed to be somewhat realistic with an emphasis on drifting. They utilize real physics, engine torque, traction, suspension, and downforce.",
